=== Agent Answer ===
The profile features used in the paper are: profile description, account creation date, number of followers and followees, location, and account language [3]. The approach combines textual features (using thematic information) with these profiling features to identify accounts from their way of writing tweets [1]. Among these, the number of followers and followees was used as a baseline, referred to as "Network Features" in the paper [3].
